  "rationale": "Brunello FACS screen in A549 cells treated with hydrocortisone, sorted for low versus high glucocorticoid-induced FKBP5 in three replicates. lo_rN and hi_rN correlate far more with each other than with other replicates (same infection sorted into two bins), so replicate is a blocking term (2 residual df). Knockouts that impair GR-dependent transcription (NR3C1, PAXIP1, STAG2) should be enriched in FKBP5-low. The deposited 'raw' counts had a pseudocount of 1 added to every value (no zeros, 30% exactly 1), so 1 was subtracted before analysis."
